At Tue, 8 Aug 2006 19:57:58 +0100,
Jochen Voss wrote:
> 
> This is the promised patch to enable capture support on the M-Audio
> Revolution 5.1 card.
> 
> part 1: add AK5365 support to i2c/other/ak4xxx-adda.c
> part 2: register the card's AK5365 ADC with ALSA

Thanks, I applied them to ALSA HG tree now.

> 
> The mute button support is still missing.
> If I find time, I will post a patch on top of these two
> to enable the mute button.

OK.  The switch should be named "Capture Switch" or rather "PCM
Capture Switch" since the volume is "PCM Capture Volume".

We normall don't use "mute" in the control name because the switch is
supposed to be positive: on = on, off = off.


